# CLIC: Product Cost & Infrastructure Cost Estimation

This artifact outlines the product development and infrastructure cost estimations for the CLIC (Climate/Crop Learning & Information Centre) application, comparing different sourcing rates and professional standards.

---

## 1. Product Development Cost Estimation (CapEx)

