## 2. Infrastructure & Third-Party Service Cost Estimation (OpEx)

Hosting, database, monitoring, and communication API costs computed over a **12-month duration**:

| # | Server / Service | Specification | Cost/Month (₹) | Duration (Months) | Total Cost (₹) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | Application Server (API) | 4 vCPU, 8 GB RAM, 50 GB SSD – Azure/AWS | ₹4,500 | 12 | ₹54,000 |
| 2 | Database Server (PostgreSQL) | 4 vCPU, 16 GB RAM, 100 GB SSD – Managed DB | ₹6,000 | 12 | ₹72,000 |
| 3 | SMS & WhatsApp Gateway | Twilio/MSG91 (25k OTP and notification messages/month) | ₹4,000 | 12 | ₹48,000 |
| 4 | Email Server (AWS SES - Noreply) | Transactional email delivery (10k emails/month) | ₹500 | 12 | ₹6,000 |
| 5 | Media Storage Bucket & CDN | AWS S3 + Cloudflare CDN (Videos, manuals & images) | ₹1,200 | 12 | ₹14,400 |
| 6 | Redis Cache & Queue Manager | Session caching and background job worker processing | ₹1,500 | 12 | ₹18,000 |
| 7 | External APIs | Weather API & Mapbox Geocoding APIs | ₹1,800 | 12 | ₹21,600 |
| 8 | Application Monitoring & Logs | Sentry error tracking + Datadog server health metrics | ₹2,000 | 12 | ₹24,000 |
| **Total** | **Infrastructure Expenses** | | **₹21,500** | | **₹258,000** |
